00:21:09.600 --> 00:21:10.400
Oh, absolutely.

00:21:10.400 --> 00:21:13.440
What kind of preventative care models could they pioneer

00:21:13.440 --> 00:21:16.320
if they were finally operating on solid ground

00:21:16.320 --> 00:21:19.440
with the financial peace of mind that the rest of the nation enjoys?

00:21:19.440 --> 00:21:20.880
It changes the entire paradigm.

